be attained by means of a change of variables, obtaining an isomorphic curve C ′ satisfying
all the requirements. Then, the generators of SC ′ ,∞ = SC,∞ mentioned in the statement
of Theorem 2.1 are just the values δ0 , . . . , δg associated with the family of approximates
given by the approximate roots of C ′ (see Definition 2.3). Notice also that δ0 coincides
with deg(C ′ ).
