+Given the allegedly forbidden representation
+
+```text
+rho_0 : pi_1(A^2-D_0) ->> S_4,
+```
+
+the transported representation is, in the correct direction,
+
+```text
+rho_{b,c} = rho_0 o (W_*)^{-1} : pi_1(A^2-D_{b,c}) ->> S_4.
+```
